["File: VLF_MemberData.txt  \r\nClassification: Restricted – Internal Use Only  \r\nGenerated: 2024-10-19  \r\nSource Node: V-CTRL.42  \r\nEncryption Signature: Verified\r\n\r\nACTIVE OPERATIVES – REDACTED FIELD SUMMARY  \r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n[REDACTED-01]  \r\nCodename: ████████  \r\nRole: Logistics Intercept / Comms Relay Hijack  \r\nLast Known Location: En route to Southern Comm Tower  \r\nStatus: [ACTIVE]  \r\n\r\n[REDACTED-02]  \r\nCodename: “Lancer”  \r\nRole: Forward Sabotage / Demo Specialist  \r\nUnit: Black Echo Cell  \r\nNotes: Reported successful plant at VEKTOR-11 site.  \r\nStatus: [NO CONTACT – 3 DAYS]  \r\n\r\n[REDACTED-03]  \r\nCodename: “Reza Nahl”  \r\nRole: Command Liaison / Strategic Coordination  \r\nClearance: LEVEL-3  \r\nKnown Attachments: Intel Section 4D, Demo Team Echo  \r\nStatus: [ACTIVE]  \r\n\r\n[REDACTED-04]  \r\nCodename: ████████  \r\nRole: Counter-Intel Operations  \r\nNotes: Identity unknown. Suspected to be embedded in UICS command perimeter.  \r\nStatus: [DEEP COVER]  \r\n\r\n[REDACTED-05]  \r\nCodename: “Marshal Vex”  \r\nRole: Oversight Division / Morale Monitoring  \r\nDocuments Linked: `internal_morale_report.vlfdoc`  \r\nStatus: [STATIONED – CENTRAL BUNKER]  \r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nWARNING: Unauthorized distribution of agent profiles is a violation of Directive VLF-7A.  \r\nSystem access log will be reviewed upon next sync.\r\n\r\n> END OF FILE"]="Arquivo: VLF_MemberData.txt",
