["His directions were vague, but <strong>FANG</> has found the two locations he meant. Check each of them out and see what blueprints you can find for the H.A.S. You are being sent a little deeper into <strong>QUARRY</> than you might have previously explored, so plan ahead: close quarters, flashlight, etc. You’re going to be all over <strong>QUARRY</>, so try to minimize exposure. Good luck and get out."]="His directions were vague, but <strong>FANG</> has found the two locations he meant. Check each of them out and see what blueprints you can find para a H.A.S. You are being sent a little deeper into <strong>QUARRY</> than you might have previously explored, so plan ahead: close quarters, flashlight, etc. You’re going to be all over <strong>QUARRY</>, so try to minimize exposure. Good luck and get out.",
