["Huh. <strong>VLF</> <strong>SỪNG TRÂU</> also had you check up on the Market a while back too. Anyway, place the five cameras the <strong>UICS</> provided at the designated vantage points along the foot trail behind the previously-abandoned Market on <strong>DELTA</>. Good luck and get out."]="Hã. A <strong>VLF</>, o <strong>SỪNG TRÂU</>, também te fez verificar o Mercado um tempo atrás. Enfim, posicione as cinco câmeras que a <strong>UICS</> forneceu nos pontos de observação designados ao longo da trilha atrás do Mercado antes abandonado no <strong>DELTA</>. Boa sorte e saia.",
