["Judging by what they wrote, the footage from the cameras was very insightful. Unfortunately, they did not communicate to you or <strong>FANG</> what they saw. If what was captured is as valuable as they hint it to be, <strong>FANG</> needs to know. Hack into the terminal on <strong>QUARRY</> and download the footage. Good luck and get out."]="A julgar pelo que escreveram, as filmagens das câmeras foram muito reveladoras. Infelizmente, não comunicaram a você nem à <strong>FANG</> o que viram. Se o que foi capturado é tão valioso quanto sugerem, a <strong>FANG</> precisa saber. Invada o terminal no <strong>QUARRY</> e baixe as filmagens. Boa sorte e saia.",
