["Mission accomplished. The targets have been efficiently neutralized. It was a regrettable, yet necessary action."]="Missão cumprida. Os alvos foram neutralizados com eficiência. Foi uma ação lamentável, porém necessária.",
["Mission completed, good job Operator. Walking around H.A.S. like a building inspector is certainly underutilizing your skills. Also, did you see anything odd about the roofs on the bigger buildings? Something that <strong>FANG</> redacted from the mission that I’ll risk disclosing is that <strong>SỪNG TRÂU</> seems paranoid about the H.A.S., like the buildings are after him personally.\r\n\r\nAs always, let me know if you have any of the following: headaches, dizziness, balance issues, high temp, shortness of breath, or nausea."]="Missão concluída, bom trabalho, Operador. Andar pelo H.A.S. como um inspetor de obras certamente é subutilizar suas habilidades. Além disso, você notou algo estranho nos telhados dos prédios maiores? Algo que a <strong>FANG</> censurou da missão e que vou arriscar revelar é que <strong>SỪNG TRÂU</> parece paranoico com o H.A.S., como se os prédios estivessem atrás dele pessoalmente.\r\n\r\nComo sempre, avise-me se tiver algum dos seguintes sintomas: dores de cabeça, tontura, problemas de equilíbrio, febre, falta de ar ou náusea.",
["Mission completed. Remember, it’s for the greater good. I’ll contact you soon for your next mission.\r\n\r\nAs always, let me know if you have any of the following: Headaches, dizziness, balance issues, high temp, shortness of breath, or nausea."]="Mission completed. Remember, it’s para a greater good. I’ll contact you soon for your next mission.\r\n\r\nAs always, let me know if you have any of the following: Headaches, dizziness, balance issues, high temp, shortness of breath, or nausea.",
