["Snake In The Grass"]="Cobra na Grama",
["Sneak"]="Furtivo",
["So I hear you’re one of the best to get shit done around here? If that’s true, got something that might interest you…\r\n\r\nKnow where the Edmonton Grain Factory is? It’s that grimey shithole not far from you.\r\n\r\nAfter everyone fled and went running towards the cities for help, a group of degenerates took over and are hoarding all the supplies, attacking anyone that goes near the place.\r\n\r\nI’ve heard it’s not only supplies they’re hoarding though; rumour has it government vehicles have been spotted going in and out of the place like clockwork… the same government that was supposed to have collapsed.\r\n\r\nAs far as I’m concerned, some shady shit is going on and if you’re up for the task, I’d like you to go there and search the place, see if you can find any files or evidence that explain what the fuck is going on.\r\n\r\nI’ll make this worth your while.\r\n\r\nZ"]="So I hear you’re one of the best to get shit done around here? If that’s true, got something that might interest you…\r\n\r\nKnow where the Edmonton Grain Factory is? It’s that grimey shithole not far from you.\r\n\r\nAfter everyone fled and went running towards the cities for help, a group of degenerates took over and are hoarding all the supplies, attacking anyone that goes near the place.\r\n\r\nI’ve heard it’s not only supplies they’re hoarding though; rumour has it government vehicles have been spotted going in and out of the place like clockwork… the same government that was supposed to have collapsed.\r\n\r\nAs far as I’m concerned, some shady shit is going on and if you’re up para a task, I’d like you to go there and search the place, see if you can find any files or evidence that explain what the fuck is going on.\r\n\r\nI’ll make this worth your while.\r\n\r\nZ",
["So, leadership infighting appears to continue. What a mess. Your mission is to kill just two <strong>IGC</> soldiers on <strong>DELTA</>. This feels like too little, but you do as they say. It is the duty of <strong>FANG</> Operators to not ask questions and trust that <strong>FANG</> has their interest at heart. You’ve been doing well thus far, and you can be sure I’m looking into this. Good luck and get out."]="Então, a briga interna da liderança parece continuar. Que bagunça. Sua missão é matar apenas dois soldados da <strong>IGC</> no <strong>DELTA</>. Parece pouco, mas você faz o que eles dizem. É dever dos Operadores da <strong>FANG</> não fazer perguntas e confiar que a <strong>FANG</> tem seus interesses no coração. Você tem ido bem até agora, e pode ter certeza de que estou investigando isso. Boa sorte e saia.",
["So, shoot up the factory and draw some blood to satiate their bloodlust, I suppose.\r\n\r\nThere is something else <strong>FANG</> needs you to do while you are in the factory. In the office, there will be a terminal with important data related to the final operation of the satellite. Download the data there to your GCPS and submit it back to <strong>FANG</>. When prompted, you will need to enter a password. Luckily, <strong>FANG</> intelligence has sourced them for you. You can find them in a text document in the terminal. That’s all for now. Let this be your only failure. And get out."]="Então, metralhe a fábrica e derrame um pouco de sangue para saciar a sede de sangue deles, suponho.\r\n\r\nHá algo mais que a <strong>FANG</> precisa que você faça enquanto estiver na fábrica. No escritório, haverá um terminal com dados importantes relacionados à operação final do satélite. Baixe os dados para o seu GCPS e os envie de volta à <strong>FANG</>. Quando solicitado, você precisará inserir uma senha. Felizmente, a inteligência da <strong>FANG</> as obteve para você. Você pode encontrá-las em um documento de texto no terminal. Isso é tudo por agora. Que esta seja sua única falha. E saia.",
["Soap"]="Sabonete",
["Soccer Trophy"]="Troféu de futebol",
["Solarint - AI Engineer"]="Solarint - Engenheiro de IA",
["Soldier, action is required. We've identified the military base near the river as the UICS's main hub for communications. We're asking you to install jammers to obstruct their communication efforts in that vicinity."]="Soldado, ação necessária. Identificamos a base militar perto do rio como o principal centro de comunicações da UICS. Pedimos que instale bloqueadores para obstruir os esforços de comunicação deles naquela região.",
["Soldier, an operation is ready for you. The evidence points to UICS leveraging tanks scattered across the map for their communications. Let’s tactfully place jammers in these areas to scramble their signals!"]="Soldado, uma operação está pronta para você. As evidências apontam que a UICS usa tanques espalhados pelo mapa para suas comunicações. Vamos posicionar bloqueadores com tato nessas áreas para embaralhar os sinais deles!",
["Soldier, reconnaissance teams have identified a sensitive VLF intel item stashed near their forward base. We believe it’s physical — likely a secured disc or data drive.\r\nYour mission is to recover it and access one of their terminals nearby to initiate a full scan. We don’t need to extract the hardware — just the data.\r\nExpect resistance once you’re close. The VLF won’t take kindly to someone poking around in their files. Keep it clean, and don’t linger."]="Soldado, equipes de reconhecimento identificaram um item de intel sensível da VLF escondido perto da base avançada deles. Acreditamos que seja físico — provavelmente um disco ou drive de dados seguro.\r\nSua missão é recuperá-lo e acessar um dos terminais deles por perto para iniciar uma varredura completa. Não precisamos extrair o hardware — apenas os dados.\r\nEspere resistência quando se aproximar. A VLF não vai gostar de alguém mexendo nos arquivos deles. Faça direito e não demore.",
["Soldier, we’ve identified a data terminal inside the VLF’s underground installation — in the large cave section of their bunker. That terminal contains intel critical to our forward planning.\r\nYour orders are to infiltrate the site, locate the terminal, and run a full scan of the specified file. You won’t need to retrieve the file — we only need a diagnostic.\r\nThis is enemy ground. Keep it tight, stay mobile, and don’t waste time once the scan begins. If they catch wind of you, you’ll have to fight your way out."]="Soldado, identificamos um terminal de dados dentro da instalação subterrânea da VLF — na grande seção de caverna do bunker deles. Esse terminal contém intel crítico para nosso planejamento futuro.\r\nSuas ordens são infiltrar-se no local, localizar o terminal e executar uma varredura completa do arquivo especificado. Você não precisará recuperar o arquivo — precisamos apenas de um diagnóstico.\r\nIsto é território inimigo. Mantenha-se discreto, em movimento, e não perca tempo quando a varredura começar. Se eles perceberem você, terá que lutar para sair.",
["Soldier, your expertise is needed. The radar tower serves as the main communication base for the UICS. We're asking you to interfere with their operations by setting up jammers to muddle their communications."]="Soldado, sua experiência é necessária. A torre de radar serve como a principal base de comunicação da UICS. Pedimos que interfira nas operações deles instalando bloqueadores para confundir suas comunicações.",
["Some change."]="Um pouco de troco.",
["Some rope."]="Um pouco de corda.",
["Some spare water..."]="Um pouco de água extra...",
["Sometimes their level of “professionalism” really gets in the way. I think this is the kind of information you should have known earlier. At least now you know what you’re doing here. But you are not quite there yet. Get this last piece. Good luck, get out."]="Às vezes o nível de “profissionalismo” deles realmente atrapalha. Acho que esse é o tipo de informação que você deveria ter sabido antes. Pelo menos agora você sabe o que está fazendo aqui. Mas ainda não chegou lá. Pegue esta última peça. Boa sorte, saia.",
["Sorry, I was away for the past two missions, I had to deal with other business. But I want you to know that I have been reading your reports and watching closely. It's good work. Getting out of <strong>BUNKER</> is not easy. I’m glad you made it, truly. For future missions near civilian areas, look around, as <strong>FANG</> has gotten missing persons reports from locals. Just keep your eyes peeled.\r\n\r\nNow to the matter at hand. The <strong>VLF</> sent two missions for you, but they were a bit odd. First, <strong>FANG</> received a mission request from <strong>LÂM ALEXANDRE</>, sharing his anger and assigning you to kill a good dozen <strong>IGC</> soldiers. He noted that he suspected the recent attacks on their food stores to be <strong>IGC</>. LÂM said something about retaliation and keeping the <strong>IGC</> in their place. What's good is that there is no sign they know that you carried it out.\r\n\r\nThat's where it got weird. Just an hour after <strong>FANG</> received that mission request, <strong>VLF</> sent over another, by <strong>SỪNG TRÂU</>. It was clearly hastily written, but said:"]="Sorry, I was away para a past two missions, I had to deal with other business. But I want you to know that I have been reading your reports and watching closely. It's good work. Getting out of <strong>BUNKER</> is not easy. I’m glad you made it, truly. For future missions near civilian areas, look around, as <strong>FANG</> has gotten missing persons reports from locals. Just keep your eyes peeled.\r\n\r\nNow to the matter at hand. The <strong>VLF</> sent two missions for you, but they were a bit odd. First, <strong>FANG</> received a mission request from <strong>LÂM ALEXANDRE</>, sharing his anger and assigning you to kill a good dozen <strong>IGC</> soldiers. He noted that he suspected the recent attacks on their food stores to be <strong>IGC</>. LÂM said something about retaliation and keeping the <strong>IGC</> in their place. What's good is that there is no sign they know that you carried it out.\r\n\r\nThat's where it got weird. Just an hour after <strong>FANG</> received that mission request, <strong>VLF</> sent over another, by <strong>SỪNG TRÂU</>. It was clearly hastily written, but said:",
