["The MP5 A2 Fixed Buttstock is a durable and functional stock designed specifically for the MP5 family."]="A coronha fixa MP5 A2 é uma coronha durável e funcional projetada especificamente para a família MP5.",
["The MP5 A3 F Retractable Buttstock is a versatile and adjustable stock designed for the MP5 family."]="A coronha retrátil MP5 A3 F é uma coronha versátil e ajustável projetada para a família MP5.",
["The MP5 A3 Fixed Buttstock is a reliable and stable stock designed for MP5 family."]="A coronha fixa MP5 A3 é uma coronha confiável e estável projetada para a família MP5.",
["The MP5 Picatinny Rail is a tactical accessory designed for Heckler & Koch MP5 and similar submachine guns. It provides a Picatinny rail platform for attaching various accessories such as optics, lights, lasers, and more."]="O trilho MP5 Picatinny é um acessório tático projetado para a Heckler & Koch MP5 e submetralhadoras similares. Oferece uma plataforma de trilho picatinny para fixar diversos acessórios, como ópticas, lanternas, lasers e muito mais.",
["The Magpul MOE RVG vertical grip can be installed on the lower part of handguards with a picatinny rail."]="A empunhadura vertical Magpul MOE RVG pode ser instalada na parte inferior de guarda-mãos com trilho picatinny.",
["The Provided Loadout option serves as a default loadout lent by the vendor. You are still able to receive mission rewards, but all loot taken out with you will be confiscated."]="A opção de Loadout Fornecido serve como um loadout padrão emprestado pelo vendedor. Você ainda pode receber recompensas de missão, mas todo o loot levado com você será confiscado.",
["The SAG MK2.1 Handguard is a versatile accessory designed for firearms equipped with a Picatinny rail system."]="O guarda-mão SAG MK2.1 é um acessório versátil projetado para armas equipadas com sistema de trilho picatinny.",
["The SRS A2 Full Handguard is a purpose-built accessory designed for the Desert Tech SRS A2 rifle."]="O guarda-mão completo SRS A2 é um acessório feito sob medida para o rifle Desert Tech SRS A2.",
["The Shooting Range contains a number of targets for you to test your equipped weapons on. \r\n\r\nAmmunition is unlimited while you are in the hideout."]="O Estande de Tiro contém vários alvos para você testar suas armas equipadas.\r\n\r\nA munição é ilimitada enquanto você está no abrigo.",
["The Slickster Plate Carrier"]="Colete balístico The Slickster",
["The Steiner CQBL-1 Laser is a compact and advanced aiming device designed for firearms. Offers and IR and standard Laser."]="O laser Steiner CQBL-1 é um dispositivo de mira compacto e avançado projetado para armas de fogo. Oferece laser IR e padrão.",
["The VR80 Stock And Pistol Grip is a combined pistol grip and stock. It still requires a buffertube."]="A coronha e empunhadura da VR80 é uma empunhadura e coronha combinadas. Ainda requer tubo de recuo.",
["The Westerners"]="Os Ocidentais",
["The Zenitco B-10 Handguard is a rugged and reliable accessory designed for firearms equipped with a Picatinny rail system."]="O guarda-mão Zenitco B-10 é um acessório robusto e confiável projetado para armas equipadas com sistema de trilho picatinny.",
["The Zenitco B-13 Rail is a specialized firearm accessory designed to provide a Picatinny rail interface for mounting accessories onto various AK-pattern rifles. "]="O trilho Zenitco B-13 é um acessório especializado que fornece uma interface de trilho picatinny para montar acessórios em vários rifles padrão AK. ",
["The Zenitco B-33 Dust Cover is a specialized component designed for the AK-74 and AK-100 series of rifles, manufactured by the Russian company Zenitco. This dust cover serves a dual purpose, providing protection for the rifle's internal components while also serving as a mounting platform for additional accessories."]="The Zenitco B-33 Dust Cover is a specialized component designed for the AK-74 and AK-100 series of rifles, manufactured by the Russian company Zenitco. This dust cover serves a dual purpose, providing protection para a rifle's internal components while also serving as a mounting platform for additional accessories.",
["The Zenitco Klesch 2IKS3 is a compact Laser also fitting on handgun rails."]="O Zenitco Klesch 2IKS3 é um laser compacto que também encaixa em trilhos de pistolas.",
["The download was complete? Good to hear, <strong>FANG</> will be pleased. Each small step is important; now finish up."]="O download foi concluído? Que bom ouvir, a <strong>FANG</> ficará satisfeita. Cada pequeno passo é importante; agora finalize.",
["The generator is the main prerequisite of upgrading your Safehouse. Its an important first step of getting everything up and running."]="O gerador é o principal pré-requisito para melhorar seu Abrigo. É um importante primeiro passo para colocar tudo em funcionamento.",
["The lighting station serves to upgrade illumination throughout your hideout. Currently, theres only some standing lights, though with additional upgrades icandenscent and flourescent overhead bulbs become the standard."]="A estação de iluminação serve para melhorar a iluminação de todo o abrigo. No momento, há apenas algumas luzes de pé, mas com melhorias adicionais as lâmpadas incandescentes e fluorescentes de teto se tornam o padrão.",
["The maximum distance, in meters, that bots are able to see enemy targets."]="A distância máxima, em metros, que os bots conseguem ver alvos inimigos.",
["The person responsible for the oversight of the transportation of the antenna pieces has been dealt with. <strong>FANG</> is now certain that the shipment was intercepted by <strong>UICS</> before it reached <strong>DELTA</>. It is most likely in a shipping container near the <strong>QUARRY</> military base. At least, that is <strong>FANG</>’s best guess. Once again, you are still looking for box 0610001. It will look similar to the last two. Watch your six extremely carefully. You are close. Good luck, get out."]="The person responsible para a oversight of the transportation of the antenna pieces has been dealt with. <strong>FANG</> is now certain that the shipment was intercepted by <strong>UICS</> before it reached <strong>DELTA</>. It is most likely in a shipping container near the <strong>QUARRY</> military base. At least, that is <strong>FANG</>’s best guess. Once again, you are still looking for box 0610001. It will look similar to the last two. Watch your six extremely carefully. You are close. Good luck, get out.",
["The repair station serves as the place to restore firearms and armor. This typically requires materials such as cloth scraps and gun lubricant to be collected in-raid. However, eventually FANG will be able to take care of these materials for a cash fee."]="A estação de conserto serve como o local para restaurar armas de fogo e armaduras. Normalmente requer materiais como retalhos de tecido e lubrificante de armas coletados na raid. No entanto, eventualmente a FANG poderá cuidar desses materiais por uma taxa em dinheiro.",
["The rest of the message is vile and I won’t breathe those words. <strong>MYRONOVA</> says to place poison into the rice fields at three specific locations. She said this will ensure no <strong>VLF</> can eat from them, or if they do, they’ll, umm, die.\r\n\r\nI know it can be tough, doing missions that are so targeted at civilians, but this is the job, and you gotta do as they say. Know your actions are for the good of the region and if you follow through to the end here in Vietnam you will save countless lives. Prove yourself to them, steel your thoughts, good luck and get out."]="The rest of the message is vile and I won’t breathe those words. <strong>MYRONOVA</> says to place poison into the rice fields at three specific locations. She said this will ensure no <strong>VLF</> can eat from them, or if they do, they’ll, umm, die.\r\n\r\nI know it can be tough, doing missions that are so targeted at civilians, but this is the job, and you gotta do as they say. Know your actions are para a good of the region and if you follow through to the end here in Vietnam you will save countless lives. Prove yourself to them, steel your thoughts, good luck and get out.",
